# Route: guide 37 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to 56, 79
# quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Orgrimmar, Western Plaguelands, Stranglethorn Vale, Felwood, Thunder
# Bluff, Undercity, Hillsbrad Foothills, Burning Steppes, Arathi Highlands,
# The Hinterlands): near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar
# -> near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Felstone Field -> Ruins
# of Andorhal -> Gurubashi Arena -> Jaedenar -> Felpaw Village -> Jaedenar ->
# ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Shadowshard Fragments (7068;
# Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer
# 38); Arikara (5088; Arikara 28); The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge Mauler
# 36-37); Recover the Key! (7846; Hitah'ya the Keeper 51); Wanted: Vile
# Priestess Hexx and Her Minions (7861; Vile Priestess Hexx 51, Vilebranch
# Aman'zasi Guard 50-51); Summoning the Princess (656; Myzrael 44).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig
# Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the
# Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying
# the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697),
# Changing Tastes (95697), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382),
# Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's
# Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569),
# Leaders of the Fang (914), Compendium of the Fallen (1049), A Vengeful Fate
# (1102), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723), The Book of Ur (1013), The Book
# of Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109),
# Bring the End (3341), The Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice
# (92421), Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power
